This license covers the boilerplate itself — the routing file, skills, and
codex/templates structure under `.agents/`, `.claude/`, and `codex/templates/`.
It is not intended to license your novel's actual manuscript, outline, or
lore once you start filling this vault in with your own story — that
content is yours under whatever copyright terms you choose (the default,
with no separate license, is full copyright reserved to you). If you publish
your own novel's repo from this boilerplate, consider replacing this file
with your own copyright notice, or scoping it explicitly to the tooling
directories.

